 on another unit, and it would take four minutes to get help. You reach across the bed, twist, and pull. The patient is repositioned. Your back is the reason you leave this job in eighteen months."}],"$L1a"]}],"$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}]]}]]}]}]]}],false,false,"$L21",false,"$undefined","$L22","$L23"]}]
